Package: etvar
Title: Event-Targeted Vector Autoregression
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Gabor", "Pinter", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "gabor.pinter@example.com")
Description: Estimate structural vector autoregressive (VAR) models identified
    by targeting a specific event date. The package finds the orthogonal rotation
    of the Cholesky factor that best explains observed movements on the event
    date using a single structural shock. Provides tools for impulse response
    analysis, historical decomposition (including counterfactual intervention
    paths), and publication-ready diagnostic plots.
